  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Various ported games from the original Atari Flashback console that was released in 2004. 20 included games: Adventure, Air Sea Battle, Asteroids, Battlezone, Breakout, Canyon Bomber, Centipede, Crystal Castles, Desert Falcon, Food Fight, Gravitar, Haunted House, Millipede, Planet Smashers, Saboteur, Sky Diver, Solaris, Sprintmaster, Warlords, Yars' Revenge."
    },
    {
      "langue": "de",
      "text": "Verschiedene portierte Spiele von der ursprünglichen Atari Flashback-Konsole, die 2004 veröffentlicht wurde. 20 Spiele enthalten: Adventure, Air Sea Battle, Asteroids, Battlezone, Breakout, Canyon Bomber, Centipede, Crystal Castles, Desert Falcon, Food Fight, Gravitar, Haunted House, Millipede, Planet Smashers, Saboteur, Sky Diver, Solaris, Sprintmaster, Warlords, Yars' Revenge."
    },
    {
      "langue": "es",
      "text": "Una colección de juegos adaptados desde la consola original Atari Flashback, lanzada en 2004. Incluye 20 títulos clásicos:\r\n\r\nAdventure, Air-Sea Battle, Asteroids, Battlezone, Breakout, Canyon Bomber, Centipede, Crystal Castles, Desert Falcon, Food Fight, Gravitar, Haunted House, Millipede, Planet Smashers, Saboteur, Sky Diver, Solaris, Sprintmaster, Warlords y Yars' Revenge."
    }
  ],
